    "Switch Between Universal Time and Mission Elapsed Time.": "切换通用时间 UT 与任务已用时间 MET。",
    "Toggles the RCS thrusters.": "开启或关闭 RCS 姿态控制推进器。",
    "Ignites the engines.": "点燃当前活动发动机。",
    "Shuts down the engines.": "关闭当前活动发动机。",
    "Disable autopilot control": "关闭自动姿态控制，改为手动操纵。",
    "Use maximum continuous RCS thrust for manual control.": "手动操纵时使用连续的最大 RCS 推力（DIRECT）。",
    "Use fine-grained pulses of RCS thrust for manual control.": "手动操纵时使用细小的 RCS 推力脉冲（PULSE），便于精细调整。",
    "Strict Attitude Control Profile. High speed, accuracy, and propellant burn.": "STRICT：姿态调整较快、精度较高，推进剂消耗也较多。",
    "Balanced Attitude Control Profile. Medium speed, accuracy, and propellant burn.": "BALNCE：在姿态调整速度、精度与推进剂消耗之间取平衡。",
    "Relaxed Attitude Control Profile. Low speed, accuracy, and propellant burn.": "RELAX：姿态调整较缓和，精度要求与推进剂消耗较低。",
    "Null out roll rate only.": "ANY：主要消除滚转角速度，不强制对齐滚转角。",
    "Point the up vector according to the selected target.": "NORM：让飞船的上方按所选目标方向对齐。",
    "Point the up vector opposite of the selected target.": "INVERT：让飞船的上方与所选目标方向反向对齐。",
    "Inertial frame of reference fixed to the distant stars.": "STAR：固定于远处恒星的惯性参照系。",
    "Frame of reference fixed to the surface of the planet.": "SURF：相对于行星表面的参照系。",
    "Frame of reference fixed to the orbital horizon.": "ORBT：相对于轨道地平线的参照系。",
    "Frame of reference fixed to the orbital velocity of your vehicle.": "OVEL：相对于飞船轨道速度方向的参照系。",
    "Frame of reference fixed to the current target direction.": "TGT：相对于当前目标方向的参照系。",
    "Frame of reference fixed to the next planned burn direction.": "BURN：相对于下一机动点火方向的参照系。",
    "Prograde. Nose points towards orbital velocity. Up points outside orbit.": "顺行：机头沿轨道速度方向，上方朝轨道外侧。",
    "Retrograde. Nose points away from orbital velocity. Up points outside orbit.": "逆行：机头背向轨道速度，上方朝轨道外侧。",
    "Orbit Normal. Nose points towards angular momentum vector. Up points outside orbit.": "轨道法向：机头沿轨道角动量方向，上方朝轨道外侧。",
    "Orbit Anti-Normal. Nose points away from angular momentum vector. Up points outside orbit.": "反法向：机头背向轨道角动量方向，上方朝轨道外侧。",
    "Orbital Horizon Ahead. Nose points towards approaching orbital horizon. Up points away from the surface.": "朝前：机头朝向前方轨道地平线，上方背向地表。",
    "Orbital Horizon Behind. Nose points towards receding orbital horizon. Up points away from the surface.": "朝后：机头朝向后方轨道地平线，上方背向地表。",
    "Radial Outward. Nose points away from the surface. Up points towards receding orbital horizon.": "径向朝外：机头背向地表，上方朝后方轨道地平线。",
    "Radial Inward. Nose towards the surface. Up points towards approaching orbital horizon.": "径向朝内：机头朝向地表，上方朝前方轨道地平线。",
    "Velocity Outward. Nose points towards outside orbit. Up points away from orbital velocity.": "速度系朝外：机头朝轨道外侧，上方背向轨道速度。",
    "Velocity Inward. Nose points towards inside orbit. Up points towards from orbital velocity.": "速度系朝内：机头朝轨道内侧，上方朝轨道速度方向。",
    "Surface Forward. Nose points toward surface-relative velocity. Up points away from the surface.": "地表向前：机头沿地表相对速度方向，上方背向地表。",
    "Surface Backward. Nose points away from surface-relative velocity. Up points towards the surface.": "地表向后：机头背向地表相对速度，上方朝向地表。",
    "Surface Upward. Nose points away from the surface. Up points towards surface-relative velocity.": "地表向上：机头背向地表，上方沿地表相对速度方向。",
    "Surface Downward. Nose points towards the surface. Up points away from the surface-relative velocity.": "地表向下：机头朝地表，上方背向地表相对速度。",
    "Current relative distance to the target.": "到目标的当前相对距离。",
    "Current relative velocity to the target.": "相对于目标的当前速度。",
    "Distance at the closest approach to the target.": "与目标最近接近时的距离。",
    "Time until the closest approach to the target.": "与目标最近接近前的剩余时间。",
    "Target Towards. Nose points towards the target. Up points away from the surface.": "朝向目标：机头对准目标，上方背向地表。",
    "Target Away. Nose points away from the target. Up points towards the surface.": "背向目标：机头背离目标，上方朝向地表。",
    "Target Alignment. Aligns the vehicle orientation to oppose the target's orientation.": "对接对齐：使飞船朝向与目标朝向相对。",
    "Target Anti-Velocity. Nose points opposite the relative velocity to the target. Up points to target's down.": "目标逆速度：机头背向与目标的相对速度，上方朝目标下方。",
    "Warp to the next apoapsis.": "时间加速到下一个远地点。",
    "Warp to the next periapsis.": "时间加速到下一个近地点。",
    "Warp to the next SOI change.": "时间加速到下一次引力影响范围（SOI）变化。",
    "Warp to the planned burn time.": "时间加速到已规划的机动时刻。",
    "Toggle the Resource Groups window.": "打开或关闭资源分组窗口。",
    "Thrust-to-weight ratio on the surface of the currently-orbited body.": "相对于当前绕行天体表面重力的推重比（TWR）。",
    "Delete the planned burn.": "删除已规划的机动。",
    "Delete this burn.": "删除此机动。",
    "Delta-V remaining on the planned burn.": "已规划机动剩余的 Δv。",
    "How long the planned burn will take.": "预计点火时长。",
    "Time when the burn will begin.": "开始点火的时刻。",
    "Total Delta-V of this burn.": "此机动的总 Δv。",
    "Sets the flight computer to automatically execute the planned burn.": "让飞行计算机自动执行已规划的机动。",
    "Monitor the fullscreen and borderless modes cover, listed with each screen's name and resolution. A windowed window is moved by dragging it.": "全屏或无边框模式使用的显示器。窗口模式可通过拖动窗口移动。",
    "UI text size. Windows, widgets and tooltips scale with it.": "界面文字大小；窗口、控件与悬停提示会同步缩放。",
    "Global Scale of Hud elements": "HUD 仪表的整体缩放比例。",
    "This should generally be set to only a portion of the number CPU cores your system has.": "通常只需分配部分 CPU 核心用于轨道求解。",
    "Hold rotation rate in the STAR frame of reference. NOTE: RCS alone cannot perfectly cancel all rotation.": "保持相对于 STAR 参照系的转动速率；仅靠 RCS 无法完全消除所有转动。",
    "Hold rotation rate in the SURF frame of reference. NOTE: RCS alone cannot perfectly cancel all rotation.": "保持相对于 SURF 参照系的转动速率；仅靠 RCS 无法完全消除所有转动。",
    "Hold rotation rate in the ORBT frame of reference. NOTE: RCS alone cannot perfectly cancel all rotation.": "保持相对于 ORBT 参照系的转动速率；仅靠 RCS 无法完全消除所有转动。",
    "Hold rotation rate in the OVEL frame of reference. NOTE: RCS alone cannot perfectly cancel all rotation.": "保持相对于 OVEL 参照系的转动速率；仅靠 RCS 无法完全消除所有转动。",
    "Hold rotation rate in the TGT frame of reference. NOTE: RCS alone cannot perfectly cancel all rotation.": "保持相对于 TGT 参照系的转动速率；仅靠 RCS 无法完全消除所有转动。",
    "Hold rotation rate in the BURN frame of reference. NOTE: RCS alone cannot perfectly cancel all rotation.": "保持相对于 BURN 参照系的转动速率；仅靠 RCS 无法完全消除所有转动。",
