    "Expansion relative to the motor's. Raising one nozzle's throttles it back, tilting the cluster's thrust away from it.": "喷管扩张比以发动机为基准。提高某个喷管的倍率会降低其推力，并使喷管组的合推力偏离该喷管。",
    "All grain segments are already full.": "所有药柱段都已装满推进剂。",
    "Lower values extend burn time at the cost of thrust and specific impulse.": "数值越低，燃烧时间越长，但推力和比冲（Isp）越低。",
    "Size the nozzle automatically for the propellant's design chamber pressure.": "按推进剂的设计燃烧室压强自动设定喷管尺寸。",
    "The grain's initial burning surface is too small to hold a self-sustaining chamber pressure through this nozzle. Raise the initial thrust.": "药柱的初始燃烧面积太小，无法通过该喷管维持自持燃烧所需的燃烧室压强。请提高初始推力。",
    "Propellant left over after chamber pressure drops below the minimum. A higher area ratio and/or flatter grain burns deeper.": "燃烧室压强降至最低值以下后剩余的推进剂。提高喷管面积比和／或采用更扁平的药柱，可使燃烧更深入。",
    "Highest chamber pressure reached during the burn. This depends strongly on nozzle throat area.": "燃烧过程中达到的最高燃烧室压强。该值会显著受喷管喉部面积影响。",
    "The speed at which the burning surface eats into the grain at max chamber pressure. This depends strongly on chamber pressure.": "燃烧面在最高燃烧室压强下向药柱内部推进的速度；该值会显著受燃烧室压强影响。",
    "Area of the nozzle throat, which is the opening that the combustion gases must pass through.": "喷管喉部的面积，即燃烧气体通过的开口面积。",
    "Number of canopies packed in this container. They deploy together and share tuning.": "此容器内收纳的伞衣数量。它们会同时展开并共用相同设置。",
    "Canopy fabric pattern.": "伞衣布料图案。",
    "Canopy diameter when fully open. Sets drag area and packed mass, shared by every chute in this part.": "降落伞完全展开时的直径，决定阻力面积和收纳质量；同一部件上的降落伞共用此设置。",
    "Reefed canopy diameter as a fraction of full.": "收束状态下的伞衣直径占完全展开直径的比例。",
    "Time held reefed before disreefing.": "伞衣保持收束状态直至解除收束的时间。",
    "Length in meters of the riser line.": "吊带长度，单位为米。",
    "Altitude gate for an armed chute.": "降落伞已启用时的展开高度阈值。",
    "Disreef only once predicted peak deceleration would stay under this many g.": "只有在预测峰值减速度低于此 G 值时，降落伞才会解除收束并完全展开。",
    "Adds a cut element to the sequence so cutting these chutes can be staged.": "在分级序列中添加剪伞步骤，以便将切断这些降落伞的动作纳入分级。",
    "Which consumer kinds this tank automatically provides propellant for.": "此储箱会自动向哪些类型的用料装置供应推进剂。",
    "When off, nothing can draw propellant from this tank.": "关闭后，其他装置无法从此储箱取用推进剂。",
    "Then click another part with a fuel port to run a line to it.\nClick empty space to cancel.": "然后点击另一个带有推进剂接口的部件以连接管线。\n点击空白处取消。",
    "Fuel line enabled": "推进剂管线已启用。",
    "Direction fuel is allowed to flow, relative to this part. Click to cycle.": "设置相对于此部件的推进剂流向。点击可切换。",
    "Delete this fuel line": "删除此推进剂管线。",
    "When off, this decoupler will not fire and is hidden from the sequence window.": "关闭后，此分离器不会触发，并会从分级序列窗口中隐藏。"
